849 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 674 0 R
/E (With the tool, buyers are able to assess potential SME suppliers with clear, transparent scoring; while SMEs gain the ability to assess and improve both their sustainability performance and their ability to win contracts. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
850 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 674 0 R
/E (Within the tool, question selection and scoring are fully deterministic and auditable. Critically, the tool also generates tailored, source-grounded recommendations for each SME user from a curated knowledge base, presenting a novel method for inciting sustainable improvement by pairing static ratings with targeted, actionable recommendations. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
851 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 674 0 R
/E (At a time when global emissions trajectories remain misaligned with pathways required to meet international climate goals, accelerating sustainability adoption across SMEs represents one of the largest and most underdeveloped opportunities to drive scalable decarbonization, operational resilience, and supply chain transformation across the global economy.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
