868 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 676 0 R
/E (The remainder of this report is organized as follows: Section 2 examines the sustainability landscape for SMEs, including a literature review and an analysis of structural gaps between existing frameworks and SME realities. Section 3 presents the proposed rating methodology, including indicator selection, weighting logic, and scoring approach. Section 4 details the design and architecture of the AI-enabled tool that operationalizes the framework. Lastly, Section 5 considers implications for adoption, scaling, and future development)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
