/E (These categories reflect many of the most frequently assessed dimensions of environmental, social, and governance performance across industries, especially within procurement, supply chain, and operational risk contexts. While the system developed for this report incorporates a broader and more granular set of indicators tailored to SME applicability and sector-specific considerations, the sections below summarize the primary topic areas most commonly associated with sustainability assessment and disclosure.  )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [1]
