/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 691 0 R
/T (The system developed for this project was designed to preserve explainability by constraining AI use to synthesis and recommendation generation after scoring has already occurred. The tool uses retrieval-augmented generation \(RAG\) grounded in a curated knowledge base of vetted sustainability frameworks, supplier standards, and guidance documents. Restricting AI outputs to a bounded and traceable source corpus helped reduce hallucination risk while improving consistency and contextual relevance. Human oversight remained critical throughout development, particularly during indicator extraction, question standardization, and weighting calibration. AI accelerated synthesis and scalability during development, but methodological decisions and final system configuration remained controlled and validated by the project team.)
/E (The system developed for this project was designed to preserve explainability by constraining AI use to synthesis and recommendation generation after scoring has already occurred. The tool uses retrieval-augmented generation \(RAG\) grounded in a curated knowledge base of vetted sustainability frameworks, supplier standards, and guidance documents. Restricting AI outputs to a bounded and traceable source corpus helped reduce hallucination risk while improving consistency and contextual relevance. Human oversight remained critical throughout development, particularly during indicator extraction, question standardization, and weighting calibration. AI accelerated synthesis and scalability during development, but methodological decisions and final system configuration remained controlled and validated by the project team.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [21]
>>
