/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 695 0 R
/T (This repository should be understood as a starting point for the minimum viable product rather than a complete global sustainability corpus. For broader use, the knowledge base would need to be expanded across additional industries, geographies, buyer types, and regulatory environments. Given that sustainability regulation and procurement expectations vary significantly across markets and continue to evolve, the knowledge base would also need to be updated periodically. Still, the current version provides sufficient coverage to demonstrate how a tool of this kind can translate sustainability guidance into a practical SME assessment and recommendation system.)
/E (This repository should be understood as a starting point for the minimum viable product rather than a complete global sustainability corpus. For broader use, the knowledge base would need to be expanded across additional industries, geographies, buyer types, and regulatory environments. Given that sustainability regulation and procurement expectations vary significantly across markets and continue to evolve, the knowledge base would also need to be updated periodically. Still, the current version provides sufficient coverage to demonstrate how a tool of this kind can translate sustainability guidance into a practical SME assessment and recommendation system.)
/Pg 34 0 R
