<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 745 0 R
/E (Once expressed as an intensity ratio, the metric is scored against an industry benchmark. For each of the defined SME sectors \(Manufacturing, Food & Agro-processing, Consumer Goods / Apparel / FMCG, Construction / Materials, Business / Export Services\), sector-specific benchmark values for each intensity metric were sourced from publications by reputable )
/Pg 84 0 R
