/Title (This project delivers a carefully researched and constructed system designed to help accelerate sustainability adoption across SMEs. However, any scoring system built on synthesized guidance carries assumptions worth surfacing, and any tool intended for real-world use needs a credible path to adoption. The current methodology has vulnerabilities that would benefit from further hardening, and getting the tool into the hands of SMEs, buyers, and institutions will require deliberate sequencing and framing.)
/Dest [45 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 6379 0 R
/First 6405 0 R
